; nichelooks.eval - a lever's secret-niche reveal swaps in walls pre-built at
; the load (code-review C211), judged by tools\EditorTest.py phase 55.
;
; eval_arena's levers' corner: a lever at 1,22 wired to nothing, one at 2,22
; whose target is the hidden niche `arena_secret` in the south wall at 3,22.
; The niche's state reaches two chunks (0,5 holds it and the cell west of it,
; 1,5 the cell east), so `niche looks` lists both. After every press `geomhash`
; prints the walls of a FRESH bake and whether the uploaded chunks' LAYOUT
; matches it (per chunk, its buckets and index counts): a swap of the wrong
; look, or of none, in 0,5 reads STALE there, while in 1,5 - where the niche
; moves only the pin of 4,22's panel, not its triangles - it shows only in the
; look `niche looks` says is on show (live=). Between presses the state is moved
; the other ways a niche can move - by hand (`niche ... open`, a rebuild that
; builds the looks again from that state), by repainting the wall it is cut
; into (an edit's rebuild), by a new game (ResetForNewGame's batched re-stamp)
; and by loading a save made with it open (that re-stamp, then
; ApplyActiveSnapshot's). `reset` re-reads the map from its file, so it reaches
; neither batch: the new game here is `newgame`.
;
; THE PILLAR is EditorTest's, written into its scratch copy of eval_arena (no
; suite's ground has one): a pillar at 8,7, a hidden niche `arena_pillar` on its
; south face opening onto 8,8, and a lever at 8,6 on its north face. The
; niche's west neighbour 7,8 lies in chunk 1,2, which has no walls at all: it
; must hold no look, and the press must rebuild nothing (`niche looks`' last
; line counts the presses that did).
logecho on
reset
timescale 0
echo --- loaded ---
niche looks
niche 3 22 s
geomhash
echo --- the lever wired to nothing ---
press 1 22
niche 3 22 s
niche looks
geomhash
echo --- the reveal ---
press 2 22
niche 3 22 s
niche looks
geomhash
echo --- shut again ---
press 2 22
niche 3 22 s
niche looks
geomhash
echo --- opened by hand, shut by the lever ---
niche 3 22 s open
niche looks
press 2 22
niche 3 22 s
niche looks
geomhash
echo --- the wall repainted under it, then the reveal ---
editor fill walls wall_brick_old rect 2 23 4 23
niche looks
press 2 22
niche 3 22 s
niche looks
geomhash
echo --- a new game ---
newgame
niche looks
niche 3 22 s
geomhash
echo --- revealed for the save ---
press 2 22
niche 3 22 s
geomhash
save nichelooks
echo --- a load ---
load nichelooks
niche looks
niche 3 22 s
geomhash
echo --- the pillar ---
press 8 6
niche 8 8 n
niche looks
geomhash
echo --- end ---
